      {
        "id": "ShenQ",
        "name": "Twilight Assault",
        "description": "Shen recalls his spirit blade to attack with it, dealing damage based on the target's max health. The attacks are greatly empowered if it collides with an enemy champion, and all collided enemies are slowed while running away from Shen.",
        "tooltip": "Shen recalls his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spirit Blade</span>. Enemies hit by the pull are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 25/30/35/40/45% while moving away from Shen for the next 2 seconds.<br /><br />Additionally, Shen's next 3 Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">40</span> plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(2/2.5/3/3.5/4% + (0.01% Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span>. If Shen hit an enemy champion with the <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Spirit Blade</span>, the damage is increased to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">40</span> plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(5/5.5/6/6.5/7% + (0.02% Ability Power)) max Health magic damage</span> and he gains <span>50% Attack Speed</span> for those Attacks.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Each Attack deals 100% increased damage to jungle monsters (max <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">100/125/150/175/200 damage</span>).<br />Attacks against structures deal 40 damage.</span>",
